# Modul: STORE SCREENSHOTS ARE REGENERATED, NOT KEPT.
#
# `npm run screenshots:store` writes eighteen full-resolution PNGs - tens of
# megabytes that change whenever any screen does. Unlike the app icons, nothing
# in the build or in CI reads them: they are uploaded to a store console by
# hand, once per release. The SOURCES that matter (resources/icon.svg and
# resources/splash.svg) are committed; these are output.
resources/store-screenshots/
